    "title": "OpenApe Pods native mediation",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Implementation draft. See docs/architecture/pods-mobile-protocol.md for websocket frames, device proof tuple, cryptography, encrypted payloads and acceptance status. Existing DDISA provider routes are outside this service."
  },
